subckt astra_045_cmos_two_bit_flash_adc (vdd VSS vin vb b1 b0)
C0 (b0 VSS) capacitor c=100f
C1 (b1 VSS) capacitor c=100f
M1 (net5 vin net11 VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M10 (net6 vin net12 VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M11 (net2 vm net12 VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M12 (net6 net6 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M13 (net2 net6 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M14 (net12 vb VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M15 (t2b net2 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M16 (t2b net2 VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M17 (b1 t2b vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M18 (b1 t2b VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M19 (net7 vin net13 VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 (net0 vl net11 VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M20 (net3 vh net13 VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M21 (net7 net7 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M22 (net3 net7 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M23 (net13 vb VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M24 (net4 net3 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M25 (net4 net3 VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M26 (t3 net4 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M27 (t3 net4 VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M28 (net10 t3 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M29 (net8 t1 net10 vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M3 (net5 net5 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M30 (net8 t2b net10 vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M31 (net8 t1 net9 VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M32 (net9 t2b VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M33 (net8 t3 VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M34 (b0 net8 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M35 (b0 net8 VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M4 (net0 net5 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 (net11 vb VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M6 (net1 net0 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M7 (net1 net0 VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M8 (t1 net1 vdd vdd) APMOS l=1u w=20u
M9 (t1 net1 VSS VSS) ANMOS l=1u w=10u
R1 (vdd vh) resistor r=10k
R2 (vh vm) resistor r=10k
R3 (vm vl) resistor r=10k
R4 (vl VSS) resistor r=10k
